  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/mod-titles/more-composter-variants.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/LieOnLion/More-Chest-Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-creation-by-lieon-studio.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/requires-quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h1>Больше вариантов компостеров</h1><p>Наполните свои постройки красочным органическим переработанным материалом — теперь у каждого типа древесины есть свой собственный компостер.</p><p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/p7e0d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>Добавление 12 новых компостеров в Minecraft.</h2><h4>Эти компостеры также можно создать с помощью <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nemos-woodcutter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nemo's Woodcutter</a>.</h4><hr><h2>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/hunnycakehorse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/ongzm.gif\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;<sup>Текстуры из палёного дуба от <strong><em>hunnycakehorse</em></strong></sup></a></h2><hr><h1>Совместимость с заменой блоков мода <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a> 1.3.0+:</h1><p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/c8j6v.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\nПосмотрите на фермера-жителя деревни Саванна: теперь вместо обычных <em>Компостера</em> и <em>Дубовых факелов</em> игра генерирует деревню с <em><strong>Акациевым компостером</strong></em> и <em><strong>Акациевыми факелами</strong></em> (из мода <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-torch-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Torch Variants</a>).</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
